{%- comment -%}
  Decorative row of rising steps, one per level in its level color, for the bottom edge of a dark panel (404, password).
  Params: n (number of levels).
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="mu-steps" aria-hidden="true">
  {%- for i in (1..n) -%}<span class="mu-h-{{ i }}" style="--i: {{ i }}"></span>{%- endfor -%}
</span>
